window.products.push({"id":151006,"name":"3406107 Dryer Door Switch by Beaquicy - Replacement for Whirlpool, Ken-more, Roper, Amana, Crosley Dryer (6-Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vXWwdfCDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【6 PACK 3406107 DRYER DOOR SWITCH】-- 3406107 Door switch is replacement part for a dryer. This 3-wire switch has a flat plug with a round connection that fits and works exactly like the original part. The 3406107 dryer door switch is a sensor that prevents the dryer door from rotating when it is opened. When you open the door, the door switch sends a signal to the electronic control panel to stop the dryer.Product is plastic and white.Electrical specs: 120-240V, 50-60Hz, 11A, 1/3HP. ✅【ABS PLASTIC】-- Includes 6 x 3406107 dryer door switch.Dryer door switch with 3 wires and connector.The part is made of high quality ABS plastic to prevent breaking and leaking during the installation and use process.Acts as a safety switch that indicates and halts operation when the door is open or when a belt is broken on some units. 3406107 Dryer door switch can fixs the following symptoms: ①dryer not start, ②not shut off, ③not tumble, ④no heat, ⑤not enough heat. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】-- The product 3406107 dryer door switch supports 365 days return and exchange.Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer. Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period,please contact customer service in time.We will try our best to solve the problem.Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit.To confirm that the door switch is faulty, unplug the dryer when the symptom occurs. ✅【HIGH COMPATIBILITY】-- This 3406107 dryer door switch replacement for Whirl-pool, Ken-more, Ro-per, Am-ana, Cro-sley and more brand dryer.★Replaces part numbers 3406107, 3405101, 3405100, 3406101, 3406100, 3406109, WP3406107VP, 528948, AP6008561, PS11741701, EAP11741701, etc.★Compatible with the following models: LER5620KQ0, 7EWED1510YM0, 7EWED1705YM0, 7EWED1705YM1, 7EWED1730YW0, 7MMEDX550XW0, 7MMEDX550XW1, 7MNGH8000TQ0, 7MNGH8000TT0, RES7745RQ0, CED137HXW0, CED147HXW0, and more. ✅【EASY TO INSTALLATION】-- Before starting any maintenance,turn off the power and unplug the dryer.The tool used for repair 3406107 dryer door switch is a phillips screwdriver.First remove the lint net and the lint net shell screws,raise the top panel,then disconnect the door switch harness,remove the old door switch and replace it with a new one,and finally connect the harness to complete the repair.If you're not sure how to install it,you can learn from the YouTube,there are more details on it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vXWwdfCDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B087WLGT25","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-151006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087WLGT25","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B087WLGT25","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
