window.products.push({"id":151205,"name":"OEM 6601ER1004C Washer Door Lock Assembly by Techecook - EBF49827801 Replacement for Kenmore & LG Washing Machine - Replaces 6601ER1004E EBF49827802 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GHlcMJt1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔✔【POWERFUL FUNCTION】: OEM 6601ER1004C Door Lock Assembly has the following functions: Prevents the washer door from opening during the wash cycle or spin cycle. This EBF49827801 ps3533609 Washer Door Lock Assembly fixes the following symptoms: ▶Washing machine will not start ▶Lid or door won’ t close ▶Lid or door will not open ▶Multiple codes running intermittently ▶Washing machine stops in the load ▶DE error ▶Washing machine stops or takes longer than usual ▶The lid spins open while washing ✔✔【PACKAGE INCLUDES】: 1 x 6601ER1004C Door Lock Assembly OEM. EBF49827801 Washer Door Lock Latch Assembly is installed on the washing machine. The 6601ER1004C Washing Machine Door Switch and Lock Assemble Replacement is made of durable high quality ABS plastic and stainless steel metal material and tested for good durability and precise fit, the upgraded door lock has improved cracking and deformation and is less prone to wear and tear, enhanced ability to prevent corrosion, giving the door lock a longer life, high quality product, 100% brand new ✔✔【FIT MODEL】: The 6601er1004c ps3533609 washer door switch and lock fit for Kenmore & LG Washing Machine,compatible for wm2277hw, wm3470hva, wm3875hvca, wm2688hnm, wm0642hw, wm2050cw, wm3370hwa, WH2455HW, wm2650hwa, wm2301hw, wm2688hnma, wm2010cw, wm3885hcca, wm3875hwca, wm2701hv, wm1355hr, wm1355hw, wm3455hs, 79641722000, 79641379211, 79640512900, 79640518900, 79641022900, 79641028900, 79641029900, 79641373211, 79641472210. Please make sure to check your machine model before purchasing the tool ✔✔【EASY TO INSTALL & MAINTENANCE】: Disconnect the power before installing this Washer Door Lock Switch ap4998848 6601ER1004C and wear work gloves to protect your hands. The tools you need to use is a Phillips screwdriver. You can enter from the Top of the machine(easier than accessing thru door and removing tub seal), removing 2 back screws holding the lid in place, then removing the 2 front screws holding the DSLA in place. Remove the screws on the latch itself then you can reach inside the front from the top and unplug it. Remove old assembly, put new one in. You can watch YouTube videos which has great tips. After installation, ensure that the device on the latch is securely connected ✔✔【365-DAY WARRANTY】: During the warranty 365 days period, if the 6601ER1004C ps3533609 Washer Door Lock Switch OEM has quality problem or other reasons, we support return, replacement or refund. Customers’ satisfaction are our unremitting pursuit. If you have any questions about our products or services, please feel free to contact us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GHlcMJt1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techecook","source_asin":"B09XWZRVTF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-151205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XWZRVTF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XWZRVTF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
