window.products.push({"id":151485,"name":"Samsung RFG293HARS 29.0 Cu. Ft. Stainless Steel French Door Refrigerator - Energy Star","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S3RQ5l3mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"More usable space inside for easier storage This large 28 cu. ft. refrigerator won t take up more space in your kitchen. Our strong, thin-wall insulation technology gives you more usable space inside for easier storage and organization. LED lighting Samsung's best-in-class LED lighting gently brightens every corner of your refrigerator so you can see better. Plus, our LED lighting emits less heat and is more energy efficient than traditional lighting. Twin Cooling keeps food fresher Samsung's Twin Cooling System ® controls and generates cooling air for the refrigerator and freezer separately. Airflow between the two stays separate so the freezer air stays drier, while the refrigerator's moisture level stays at 42%-almost 5x higher than single cooling systems resulting in fruits and veggies that stay fresher, longer. ENERGY STAR ® Compliant You'll save money while conserving energy with our ENERGY STAR ®-rated refrigerators. Plus, a handy alarm alerts you when the door is left ajar or open too long. Superior Ice Production and Storage Your parties just got bigger. Samsung refrigerators produce large amounts of ice so you never run out. Our extra ice storage helps ensure you have ice on hand at all times. Attractive Design and Large Capacity Samsung refrigerators bring innovation to both design and storage. Our beautiful and sleek design complements any kitchen decor. And, the enhanced storage capacity offers more space inside with the same outside dimensions as a traditional model. That s more room to hold your favorite drinks, party platters and leftovers. Cool Select Pantry This full-width drawer with adjustable temperature controls provides storage space for specific food storage needs. Temperature options include; Quick Cool, Thaw and Soft Freeze, Chill Mode, and Cool Mode options.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S3RQ5l3mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAMSUNG","source_asin":"B0045F7RBG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-151485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0045F7RBG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0045F7RBG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
