window.products.push({"id":151630,"name":"Kenmore 36\" Side-by-Side Refrigerator with Ice System and 25 Cubic Ft. Total Capacity, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512mLz-tjxL._AC_SL1493_.jpg","description":"When kitchen space is limited, the Kenmore 25 Cubic Ft. Side-by-Side Refrigerator with SpaceSaver Ice System is the perfect kitchen appliance. This slim refrigerator and freezer combo offers plenty of fresh and frozen food storage, and is perfect for smaller spaces, like apartments, condos, and single family homes. The innovative SpaceSaver Ice System saves valuable frozen storage space with its in-door design. With 15.44 cubic ft. of fresh refrigerated storage and 9.07 cubic ft. of cold, freezer storage, you can stock up on your next run to the grocery store. With the gallon-size door bins, you can store taller and wider food and beverage items, while still having easy access to them. The easy-to-clean glass freezer shelves give you more shelf space for easier organizing. The TuckAway shelf easily adjusts to give you 19.75” high storage space for tall containers, like 2-liter bottles and juice cartons. The Pizza Pocket is the perfect spot to stash two 14\" pizza boxes right in the freezer without taking up too much space. For added convenience, the side-by-side refrigerator and freezer features energy-saving dual LED lighting that illuminate the interior to help you quickly find what you’re looking for. The ice and water dispenser is dual pad and allows you to see the spout to accurately fill up containers with small openings. The black Side-by-Side Refrigerator with Freezer measures 35.88\" W x 33.81\" D x 68.63\" H for a perfect fit in your kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512mLz-tjxL._AC_SL1493_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kenmore","source_asin":"B08FF5YHHM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-151630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FF5YHHM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FF5YHHM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
