window.products.push({"id":151829,"name":"ValueCafe ComboPack 2 Reusable Filters For Keurig 2.0 ONLY + 50 Disposable Paper Filters - Best Value - K300, K350, K360, K400, K450, K460, K500, K550","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31BDq2VfqIL._AC_.jpg","description":"Great Compatibilty; These ValueCafe filters fit all Keurig 2.0 home models EXCEPT K200 or K250; (but does NOT fit Keurig 1.0, Office, Pro, or Vue models.) Use them for making a single cup in your 2.0 brewer. (The 2.0 brewers are the ones with which you can make a carafe OR single cup.) For Keurig 1.0 models please search for item B00LHCCR92 (without paper inserts) or B06Y5YC8SF (with paper inserts). Backed by the Best Guarantee! Millions of these filters have been sold, and our product reviews and customer feedback are tops. And they are backed by our 100% No-Hassle Money Back Guarantee. If you have a problem, contact us. If we can’t fix the problem we’ll replace the filters or refund your money. (If you call Amazon customer service they will tell you that the product is not returnable. That’s Amazon’s policy, NOT ours.) Just click “Ask Seller” on your order page. Great Design! No hacks! The easiest refillable pod to use and clean! Unlike some other brands, ValueCafe refillable pods do not need any hacks, tips, or brewer modifications or add-ons to use. ValueCafe pods have been designed and engineered specifically to work with your Keurig brewer. No need to remove or swap out the filter holder. No need to remove any parts from your Keurig. Insert ValueCafe pods just as you would an expensive pre-filled pod! Save Money and Help Save the Planet- You’ll save up to 80% of pre-filled pod expense by using ValueCafe refillable pods with the coffee you choose- But did you know how quickly those use-once-then-throw-away pods are filling up our landfills? Some cities have already banned the use of disposable coffee pods, and, according to Quartz, a business-oriented news outlet, “Even the man who invented the pre-filled pod has stopped using them, saying he ‘feels bad’ about their environmental impact.”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31BDq2VfqIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ValueCafe","source_asin":"B07622BMS7","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-151829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07622BMS7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07622BMS7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
