window.products.push({"id":151878,"name":"Appliance Art Magnetic Dishwasher Front Door Cover Sheet | Kitchen Appliance Décor | Vinyl Decal for Instant Update | Trimmable Magnet | Easy to Clean","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":61.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MyRH48uGL._AC_.jpg","description":"KITCHEN ART Give your dishwasher a facelift with our Harvest magnetic front door cover. Showcasing a bottle of red and one of white, your kitchen will be ready for a celebratory wine tasting. AFFORDABLE WAY TO UPDATE THE LOOKS OF YOUR DISHWASHER: these magnetic dishwasher covers hide scratches, dents or other unsightly marks on your dishwasher - instantly, effortlessly and affordably DECORATIVE AND PRACTICAL Created to hide scratches and other unsightly marks on your dishwasher, these artsy magnetic appliance decals will enhance your kitchen’s décor. SAVE MONEY For a fraction of the price of a new dishwasher, these magnetic sheets cover and completely refresh your machine’s front door. Have you bought a new refrigerator and now the dishwasher is a different color? These magnets are an ideal solution for updating your old appliance, so it complements the rest of your kitchen. Great option and quick fix for both homeowners and renters. TROUBLE-FREE INSTALLATION This magnetic cover simply sticks to the surface of your machine. No need to deal with any harsh-smelling adhesives or sticky residue to scrub off. Just ensure that your dishwasher is magnetic before ordering this product - if a magnet sticks to your dishwasher, so will this panel. Plus, these covers are simple to peel off. If you want to vary your kitchen’s décor with the seasons/holidays, swap one Appliance Art magnetic cover design for another! EASILY TRIM TO FIT Measuring 23.5” x 26”, this refinishing cover is sized to fit most standard dishwasher doors. If the face of your washer’s door is smaller – no problem! These magnetic sheets are easy to cut. Simply measure your door then trim the cover to fit. FADE, WATER, SMUDGE & HEAT RESISTANT Door cover is made of premium PET vinyl film applied to a flexible magnetic sheet. No need to worry about visible fingerprints, damage during the hot drying cycle, or splashes of water. Plus, the cover is easy to clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MyRH48uGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"APPLIANCE ART","source_asin":"B0BBB9TZL1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-151878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBB9TZL1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBB9TZL1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
